// Going back: her life as a tree, who goes on without you, the life you leave, and the second wake.

// The tree mechanic draws her life and offers its forks; only 1985's is open in the demo.
== her_life
  [tree] [forks 1969 locked, 1985 open, 1998 locked]
Go back to a fork and live it the other way. The life you leave goes on without you.
  [hint]
+ Go back to 1985
  { life = stay: Danny, Tom, Ruth and Ellie go on without you. | Martin and Leo go on without you. }
    [warn]
  * Go back
      -> the_life_you_leave
  * Stay a little longer
      -> her_life
  * Let her rest
      -> rest

== the_life_you_leave
  [card]
In the life you left, the morning after the funeral:
{ life = stay }
  Danny sets out two cups. He does it for a year.
  Tom rings on Sunday, out of habit, and lets it ring.
  The house goes on being a house, with nobody in it you could speak to.
{ life = go }
  Leo sits at her piano and plays the second movement at the speed she wanted. Slowly. Badly. Right.
  Martin posts a recording of rain to an address that isn't there.
-> fork_1985

// Both lives in one house.
== second_wake
  [talk] [picture wake_both]
The same coffin. The same night. Both lives came.
Danny and Martin are at the same table. Neither knows why the other is crying, and neither asks.
At the foot of the coffin, two men about the same age.
TOM: Who are you?
LEO: Her son.
  [pause 0.4]
TOM: So am I.
  [pause 0.6]
* Stand beside Tom
  TOM: He's got her hands. Look at him. He's got her bloody hands.
* Stand beside Leo
  LEO: He's the one she stayed for. He doesn't know that's what he is.
* Stand between them
  They don't move apart.
- GOT_ON: we were both good at this. that's the joke.
STAYED: neither of us was the right one. there wasn't a right one.
GOT_ON: there was just the bus, and the night, and him at the table saying go.
-> rest_pick

// Which life she rests in.
== rest_pick
  [sides] [picture fork_go, fork_stay]
Dawn. One eulogy. Two lives.
  [pause 0.2]
Which life does she rest in?
* The life where she got on
  [side go]
  [rest_in(go)]
  -> rest
* The life where she stayed
  [side stay]
  [rest_in(stay)]
  -> rest
